---
title: One-Pot Miso Soup
cooklang: 2
servings: 2
cuisine: Japanese
source: recipe-pack breakfast-3/1234-one-pot-miso-soup-1
---

`Slice` @green onion{1} thinly and `cut` @silken tofu{100%g} into small cubes on a #board{}.

`Add` @water{500%ml} and @dashi packet{1} to a #saucepan{}, `cover` and `bring medium` to a boil over
medium heat.

`Shake` the @&dashi packet{} with #chopsticks{} to release more flavour, then `discard` the
@&dashi packet{}. -> dashi

`Add` the @&silken tofu{} and @wakame{1/2%tbsp}(dried) to the @&dashi{} in the #&saucepan{}.

`Turn off` the heat and `dissolve` @miso{2%tbsp} into the @&dashi{} through a #miso strainer{}.
`Bring bare simmer` to a bare simmer and `turn off` the heat; do not let it boil. -> miso soup

`Serve` the @&miso soup{} in #bowls{} and `garnish` with the @&green onion{}.
